      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tasley%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The headquarters of STAR Transit, the public‑transport agency serving the Eastern Shore, are located in Tasley.",
